  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power Transmission Project in Support of the Energy Sector Reform &amp; Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall program objective is to improve the securitycomma reliability and quality of energy supplycomma andcomma thereforecomma facilitateunimpeded operation of the energy marketcomma both domestically and internationally. The main objective of the Power TransmissionProject is to improve the securitycomma reliability and quality of power supply through the rehabilitation of transmission substationsand the strengthening of the power transmission network. The project will also aim to improve institutional capacity and technicalcapabilities of transmission system operatorcomma UkrEnergo (UE)comma so that it can assure secure and reliable operation of the highvoltage power gridcomma andcomma thereforecomma facilitate unimpeded operation and opening up of the electricity market.</narrative>
  </description>
